# Generated files — built at deploy time, never committed
index.html

# Raw meet files — these carry minors' birthdates and must never reach a public
# repo. Portfolio-wide policy, applied to every public repo regardless of whether
# it has any reason to hold one: the repos nobody expects to receive a meet file
# are where a misdirected write would go unnoticed longest.
*.sd3
*.SD3
*.hy3
*.HY3
*.cl2
*.CL2
*.zip
*.ZIP
